### 5. Bug Identification

**Bug Found:**

> When the requested sales quantity equals the available stock, the system incorrectly displays **"Product Out of Stock"** and blocks the sale. The sale should be allowed, reducing the stock quantity to **0**. Sales should only be blocked when the requested quantity exceeds the available stock.

